<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIA BEAT IRELAND 1-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIA BEAT IRELAND 1-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania beat Ireland 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship Group</p>
<p>eight qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Romania - Cornel Frasineanu 15</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p>    1. Romania	5  5  0  0  9  4  15</p>
<p>    2. Iceland	4  3  0  1  8  3   9</p>
<p>    3. Ireland	4  2  0  2  8  2   6</p>
<p>    4. Lithuanie    3  0  0  3  2  7   0</p>
<p>    5. Macedonia    4  0  0  4  1 11   0</p>
</text>
